Changelog: 20-11-2026 10:27:17

Fixed. The CI jobs no longer wait 5 minutes on a stalled download of Bazzite's font and then fail: tools/ci-font.sh installs it in the pytest and docs jobs of ci.yml and in docs.yml, cuts a try off after 45 seconds and tries three times, and asks Ubuntu's mirror for its package lists only when an install fails. On 20-11-2026 two pytest jobs of one run stalled on the 13 MB package and failed before a test ran. A change to the script runs every job, as one to tools/ci-qt-libs.sh does.

Changelog: 20-11-2026 05:35:36

