Changelog: 18-11-2026 16:36:28

Added. Nexus Remix Studio, a development app in dev/studio/ (owner, 18-11-2026). It mixes a voice with a synthesized
background and saves the result as an Ogg Vorbis, MP3, FLAC or WAV file. The voice is a sound file or a text spoken
