saved ones again with the saved portal's own installer, removes the apps installed during the test and gives the
portal back what it remembered. Before, the tested portal stayed as the installed one, also when the test failed.
An app updated during the test stays updated; --keep keeps the tested portal; the new check-release.sh restore
does the putting back by hand, and status says when a test's portal stands over the saved install.

